WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.599
Raj: Let's dial it back for authenticated tenants. I mean, reduce false rejections.

2
00:00:06.599 --> 00:00:10.583
Lukas: Which setting changes? The global rate limit?

3
00:00:10.583 --> 00:00:14.855
Raj: No, bucket identity and per-tenant burst allowance.

4
00:00:14.855 --> 00:00:19.342
Hannah: How are anonymous requests treated without identity?

5
00:00:19.342 --> 00:00:25.822
Anika: Conservative anonymous quotas. Authentication doesn't bypass safety ceilings.

6
00:00:25.822 --> 00:00:30.093
Priya: Just to confirm, trusted identity only, right?

7
00:00:30.093 --> 00:00:33.645
Lukas: Yes, not a client-supplied tenant header.

8
00:00:33.645 --> 00:00:37.629
Raj: Managed configuration holds the reviewed policy version.

9
00:00:37.629 --> 00:00:42.380
Hannah: False rejections should fall, perhaps not disappear.

10
00:00:42.380 --> 00:00:46.100
Priya: We'll keep an eye on legitimate completion rates.

